Model weights:
No pretrained model weights are included in this repository. Download them
from https://huggingface.co/signalNotNoise/shap-e-mlx at the pinned
revision in README.md and verify checksums.sha256 before use. The only
tensors checked in are the tiny random-weight stub under
Tests/ShapERuntimeTests/Fixtures/runtime_bundle_stub/, which contains no
trained parameters.
